            "is_free": false,
            "detailed_description": "DashBored is a bizarre RPG taking place in a dark and unique Universe! Nicolas is your average every day shut-in loser. <br>However, one day his world will be turned upside down when he finds himself transported to a pocket dimension for those who have lost their will to live.<br>To make matters worse, this dimension is ruled over by and evil being known as Vurrus, and a weird robot lady seems to have it out for Nic! <br>This day just will not get better! <br>Well hey, no use crying like some sort of baby loser. Pull your pants up, grab a knife, and start fighting! It's the only way to survive here!<br><br>Help Nic find his way home, meeting a cast of weird friends and enemies, each one more bizarre than the last!<br>Explore a world of varied environments, fight strange monsters, and save the universe! (Accidentally, that is.)<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/490860/extras/936724b97ae462cdec189830da9920c0.avif?t=1673572289\" width=68 height=100 /></span><br><br><br><br><br><strong>Features</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A classic style turn-based RPG.<br></li><li>Seven unique party members to recruit!<br></li><li>Strange hamstrung soundtrack.<br></li><li>Witty dialogue and funny characters!<br></li><li>Multiple Endings!<br></li><li>Travel to strange locales and meet their strange locals!<br></li><li>Large amount of characters to meet and greet.<br></li><li>Rodents that you can flip off!<br></li><li>Birds to break your fall!<br></li><li>Giant monstrosities to break your bones!</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/490860/extras/936724b97ae462cdec189830da9920c0.avif?t=1673572289\" width=68 height=100 /></span>",
